{Poset}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MA}\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{MA}\\subseteq V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Vdash_{M,\\mathbb P}\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\times V\">\\(\\Vdash_{M,\\mathbb P}\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\times V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ForcesMA}_S \\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{ForcesMA}_S \\subseteq V^7\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forces\\text{-}ma}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ForcesMA}_S(M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\kappa,1_{\\mathbb P},\\Sigma,\\theta)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathbb P\\in M\n\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\n\\land1_{\\mathbb P}\\in\\mathbb P\n\\land\\forall p\\in\\mathbb P\\;(\\langle p,1_{\\mathbb P}\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\theta=\\ulcorner\\mathrm{MA}(\\check\\kappa)\\urcorner_\\Sigma\n\\land\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\n\\land\\langle1_{\\mathbb P},\\theta\\rangle\\in\\Vdash_{M,\\mathbb P}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forces\\text{-}ma}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ForcesMA}_S(M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\kappa,1_{\\mathbb P},\\Sigma,\\theta)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathbb P\\in M\n\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\n\\land1_{\\mathbb P}\\in\\mathbb P\n\\land\\forall p\\in\\mathbb P\\;(\\langle p,1_{\\mathbb P}\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\theta=\\ulcorner\\mathrm{MA}(\\check\\kappa)\\urcorner_\\Sigma\n\\land\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\n\\land\\langle1_{\\mathbb P},\\theta\\rangle\\in\\Vdash_{M,\\mathbb P}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The ground model, forcing notion, top condition, and object-language code of Martin's axiom are explicit; the former two-place abbreviation suppressed all four.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"46b2495f214783c3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-martins-axiom.md","status":"resolved","id":"b4f557645bc9a749","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-martins-axiom.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\kappa,1_{\\mathbb P},\\Sigma,\\theta\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MA}\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Vdash_{M,\\mathbb P}\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\times V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ForcesMA}_S \\subseteq V^7","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forces\\text{-}ma}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{ForcesMA}_S(M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\kappa,1_{\\mathbb P},\\Sigma,\\theta)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathbb P\\in M\n\\land\\math